From 5e43ef6321060868186f1eec9bf13e4ed44181d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(skippy): retain shared prefixes with bounded checkpoint
 storage

Merge of the radix-cache branch queue onto the current main queue:
- resident-prefix implementation relocated to src/skippy/resident_prefix.cpp
- per-owner KV rows for attention (ggml backends)
- bounded checkpoint retention for shared multi-turn prefixes
